          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bena Yuda bakuenza malu adi mabi ku mesu kuanyi, bakushimika mpingu yabo ya tshinyangu mu nsubu udibo bambikidila dina dianyi, bua kunyanga nsubu eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuasa bibumba bia Tofete bidi mu luhongo lua muana mulume wa Hinoma, bua kuoshahu bana babo ba balume ne bana babo ba bakashi mu kahia; badi benza bualu bundi tshiyi muele mukenji, bundi tshiyi muele meji bua bobo kubuenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa udi wamba ne, Monai matuku alualua, hikalabo kabayi babikila tshibumba ne, Tofete, anyi ne, Luhongo lua muana mulume wa Hinoma; kadi nebalubikile ne, Luhongo lua Kushihelamu Bantu; bualu bua nebajike bantu mu Tofete, kakuena kuikala muaba mukuabo wa kubajikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bitalu bia bantu aba nebikale bia kudia bia nyunyu ya mulu ne nyama ya ha buloba; kakuena kuikala muntu bua kuyihata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nendekeshe dî mu misoko ya mu Yuda ne mu misesu ya Yelushalema, dî dia tuseku ne dia disanka, dia mubaki wa mukashi ne dia mukashi udiye Ubaka kabidi; bualu bua buloba nebulue tshihela tshia hatuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
